# What a local tree may hold that git ignores, so a build from one matches the
# workflow's: the image bakes its own venv and microvm assets.
**/__pycache__
**/.terraform
.venv
benchmark-charts/build
benchmarking/.env.sh
benchmarking/tools/venv_run
benchmarking/scenario_runner/.local-data
benchmarking/scenario_runner/.terraform-plugin-cache
dependency-repos/substrate/bin
reports/*
